  "body": "nav-timeout.test.cjs \"every page with a short default timeout loads with a minute's room\" is red on origin/main 84ad780b6 (mote, `node --test internal/gui/tests/nav-timeout.test.cjs`):\n\n```\nnot ok - every page with a short default timeout loads with a minute's room\n  error: a page.goto under a short default times out on a busy machine's first load\n    + [\n    +   'accounts-own-signin.test.cjs: page.setDefaultTimeout(5000)',\n    +   'accounts-switch-alone.test.cjs: page.setDefaultTimeout(5000)',\n    +   'icon-one-tone.test.cjs: page.setDefaultTimeout(5000)',\n    +   'provider-retrieval-only.test.cjs: page.setDefaultTimeout(5000)'\n    + ]\n```\n\nEach file sets a 5s default without `page.setDefaultNavigationTimeout(60000)`. Last commits on them: 1ae48d7f4, 823e7c250, 4164edce6, acde144a7. Same class as #4787 (window-visibility), with four other files. Found while shipping the request up/down bytes change, which does not touch them; not taking it.\n",
  "closed_by": null,
