   "body": "A test-only fix is on [the fork branch](https://github.com/skygunner/magpie/tree/fix/5425-nav-timeout-siblings), commit [10275d5a6](https://github.com/skygunner/magpie/commit/10275d5a6e63f14f541d26ed122220ba49d3aad2), based on ed0ab567.\n\nThe guard on this base lists nine files, not four: agent-details-ready at 8s plus model-api-decide, model-headers, model-limits and provider-list-off. Every sibling now keeps its short click/assertion default and adds a 60s navigation timeout beside it.\n\n`nav-timeout.test.cjs` fails before and passes after, all nine files pass `node --check`, and the full offline nogui build, formatting and diff checks pass. Those browser suites were not rerun here and no production or GUI asset changed. AI-assisted implementation and review.",
   "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
