   "body": "Seen again, on WSL (Ubuntu 24.04): i18n-keys, i18n-en-no-cjk, icon-one-tone, routing-client-icons and icon-tile run together with --test-concurrency=1 were 60/63. The 3 reds were all icon-one-tone's \"chromium: Open Design's one-tone picture is drawn in the text colour on the Plugins page\" (2 subtests). The same file passed 48/48 alone, at the Kun branch and at origin/main 6a450c498, and the five files together passed 63/63 at 0baa223ec. This fits the 5s navigation default named here. Not taking it.",
