     "body": "Full GUI suite on mote (macOS 27), `node --test --test-concurrency=2 internal/gui/tests/*.test.cjs`, at origin/main 84ad780b6: 21163 tests, 20839 pass, **324 fail** (#4304 was 36 files at c1da9ccda).\n\nThey were red before 84ad780b6. Ten of the files run together alone (provider-fetch-again, provider-typed, provider-picks-stay, provider-models-rest, vertex-editor, key-replace, tencent-cloud, provider-levels-scroll, zero-priced-free, models-select-all-api): 70 fail at 84ad780b6 and **72 fail at its parent ef176e21f**. Some are deterministic, not load. provider-typed (#4673) sends `key: ''` where it expects `'sk-new-typed'`, even run alone. Known files: provider-typed #4673, provider-picks-stay and gateway-key-models #5233, i18n-keys #5332.\n\nFails per file:\n\n```\n  20 zero-priced-free.test.cjs\n  20 model-chip-steady.test.cjs\n  19 rest-try-now.test.cjs\n  16 segs-press-redraw.test.cjs\n  14 provider-fetch-again.test.cjs\n  11 page-width-steady.test.cjs\n  10 recovered-file.test.cjs\n   9 models-select-all-api.test.cjs\n   8 vertex-editor.test.cjs\n   8 routing-intent-entry.test.cjs\n   8 models-works-only.test.cjs\n   6 routing-rule-remove.test.cjs\n   6 routing-many-keys.test.cjs\n   6 key-replace.test.cjs\n   5 usage-fold.test.cjs\n   5 routing-rule-drag.test.cjs\n   5 context-map.test.cjs\n   4 tray-cell-click.test.cjs\n   4 tencent-cloud.test.cjs\n   4 provider-typed.test.cjs\n   4 provider-picks-stay.test.cjs\n   4 provider-models-rest.test.cjs\n   4 plugin-move-unserved.test.cjs\n   4 phone-connect-menu.test.cjs\n   4 model-copy-id.test.cjs\n   4 menu-input-scroll.test.cjs\n   3 title-bar-tools.test.cjs\n   3 import-row.test.cjs\n   2 usage-ledger.test.cjs\n   2 usage-agents-hide.test.cjs\n   2 routing-steady.test.cjs\n   2 routing-row-swap.test.cjs\n   2 remote-magpie.test.cjs\n   2 omarchy.test.cjs\n   2 mobile-web.test.cjs\n   2 found-skill-pick-remove.test.cjs\n   2 codex-auto-reset.test.cjs\n   2 agent-own-direct.test.cjs\n   1 usage-focus-steady.test.cjs\n   1 skill-where.test.cjs\n   1 s3-sync.test.cjs\n   1 routing-story-shrinks.test.cjs\n   1 routing-steps-cap.test.cjs\n   1 routing-stage-routes.test.cjs\n   1 routing-order-unknown.test.cjs\n   1 reasoning-speed.test.cjs\n   1 provider-levels-scroll.test.cjs\n   1 nav-timeout.test.cjs\n   1 models-fold.test.cjs\n   1 images-codex-one.test.cjs\n   1 i18n-keys.test.cjs\n   1 header-centre.test.cjs\n   1 group-found-skip.test.cjs\n   1 gateway-key-models.test.cjs\n   1 gateway-caller-keys.test.cjs\n   1 account-weight.test.cjs\n```\n\nGo suite (`go test -timeout 45m ./...`) on mote at the same head: red only in TestMainWindowCorners (#3949) and TestStopLetsARenewalEnd (#2743, at its line-61 assertion).\n",
